window.products.push({"id":666127,"name":"Top Split Queen-White Solid Sheet Set for Split-Head Adjustable Bed, 32\" Split at Top, 800 Thread Count 100%-Long-Staple-Cotton Top-Split Sheet-Set, F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519CNSDgogL._AC_SL1443_.jpg","description":"Product Description: 100% Ultra-soft pure cotton 800 thread count sheets set. Top Split With 32\" Split On the Top.Wrinkle Free, No Shrinkage, No Pilling, No Fading. Designed to fit Thick Mattress Up to 15 Inch. Set The Standard: Beautiful to look at. Even better with your eyes closed. Our 4-piece top split head sheet set is made to impress from first rest. Set Includes: 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet and 2 pillowcases. Fits mattresses up to 15” Deep Pocket. Designed to make you feel Comfort and Luxury at the same time. Made with High Quality Pure Cotton 800 Thread Count Yarns which are Cooler in Summer and Warm in Winter. 100% Cotton Quality Sheets. Long lasting durable Long Staple Yarns Fabric designed to last for years and years of Luxury and Comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519CNSDgogL._AC_SL1443_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Versatile Bedding","source_asin":"B0C6628SKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6628SKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6628SKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":666128,"name":"Bodum Nissen Acrylic Salt Grinder, Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Wa2DPsoQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The perfect addition to any tablesetting, Bodum's Nissen Small Salt Grinder brings freshly ground salt to the table in a functional size and design. Clear acrylic is crafted into a contemporary kitchen and tableware collection to complement any style preference. The Nissen grinder is easy to use, both when cooking and garnishing your meal. Refilling the grinder is made simple with the convenient top filling design that makes it easy to add more salt to the grinder - just hold the base, pull the top off and then fill the grinder with salt. The blade is constructed with ceramic that will not corrode. Because the blades are made from ceramic they will work with a variety of other spices. The easy to grip adjusting nut makes it easy to set the ideal grind from coarse to fine, just the way you like it. The smooth action and consistent grind will impress the guests. The Nissen grinder comes filled with salt, so your first few grinds are on us. Whether you are a professional chef or a novice cook, you will enjoy having these pieces both in your kitchen as a functional salt grinder and on your table as a stylish accessory. Designed to last, the Nissen Small Grinder comes complete with a 10-year warranty. Purchase this grinder together with the Nissen Small Acrylic Pepper Grinder for a matching set. Amazon.com Bodum, a family-owned company that wins awards for its well-designed coffee makers and kitchen products, sticks to the philosophy that \"good design doesn't have to be expensive.\" Building on its Danish modern roots, Bodum produces the Nissen line of pepper and salt grinders. Each is comprised of a clear, acrylic base that fits comfortably in the hand and lets you see how many peppercorns or salt crystals are left inside. A silver-toned cylindrical top provides a contemporary accent. Acrylic doesn't mean flimsy, however; the Nissen is so sturdy that Bodum covers the grinder with an impressive 10-year warranty. Available in three sizes, the Nissen salt grinder is fitted with a ceramic grinding mechanism that stays sharp and never corrodes. A wing-nut easily turns to adjust the grind, which can range from a fine sprinkling of salt on sandwiches to coarser crystals on roast meat. The cylindrical top turns smoothly for quick action, and removes for handy top-filling. Bodum graciously fills the grinder with salt crystals to get you started. Pair the salt grinder with a matching Nissen pepper grinder for a contemporary tabletop set. The heights and diameters of the Nissen grinders are as follows: large, 13-1/2 by 3-1/4 inches; medium, 8-3/4 by 2-1/2 inches; small, 4-3/4 by 1-3/4 inches. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Wa2DPsoQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B000F5M44K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000F5M44K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000F5M44K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":666129,"name":"Madhu International Mandala Black Base Chakra Tapestry Curtain for Living Room Bedroom 2 Panel Drapes (W41 X L87, Black Gold - Gold Lace)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914tPPkyUBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material: Perfect Drapes For Summer And Winter. Handcrafted With Pure Cotton Fabric, These Chakra Bohemian Living Room Curtains Are Superior To Other Tapestry Curtains In The Market And Are So Soft, Stretchy, Thick And Durable. Designed To Reduce Some Unwanted Light For Any Living Spaces, This Curtain Drape Set Prevents Both Excess Sun Rays And Wind From Entering The Room That Helps To Maintain The Temperature Of The Room At A Moderate Level. Ideal Accessory For All Seasons. Perfect Size: Create A Happy Mood With The Help Of These Cotton Handmade Curtains! The Fringes In Our Long Tapestry Curtains Make Any Living Space More Elegant And Luxurious Than Before. This Decorative Curtain Set Contains 2 Panels Each Measuring 41 Inches Wide By 87 Inches Long Which Is Long Enough To Cover All Kinds Of Doors And Windows. Our Tapestry Curtains With Tassels Come With Built-in Road Pockets Which Are Designed To Fit For Curtain Rods Up To 2.5 Inches In Diameter. Ambience Decoration: Welcome Your Guest And Make Them Astonished With Our Tasseled Curtains. These Timeless Classic Hanging Drapes Decorate Your Home With Fresh Effects And Give A Happy Mood. The Simple Design Pattern Of Our Front Door Decor Curtains Has A Creative Look That Tricks Out A Graceful And Chic Appearance To Any Space. It Surely Brightens Up Your Home Decorations And Creates A Festive Mood. These Curtains With Lace Perfectly Match Any Home Style. Attractive Design: Add A Sense Of Ethnic Feel To All Living Spaces! Infused With Indian Traditional Style, These Tassel Curtains Are Made With Care By Local Artisans Focusing Mainly On Each Detail Of The Curtain Design. The Advanced Hd Printing Technology, Floral Pattern, Clear Prints, Vivid Colors Of This Bohemian Tapestry Curtain Gives A Second Life To Any Of Your Dull Or Perished Rooms. This Bohemian Fringes Curtain Is Going To Be Your Favourite Home Decor Stuff For All Seasons. Care Instructions: You Never Have To Worry About Taking Strenuous Steps To Keep The Drapes Curtains Set Clean At All Times. They Require Very Little Maintenance And Are Easier To Keep When Compared To Other Traditional Mandala Curtains That Are Available In The Market. For Long-Lasting Usage, Wash In Cold Water And Spot Clean In Case Of Strains. Do Not Bleach In Any Case As The Curtains Are Made With Specially Treated Dye So That The Colors Do Not Fade With Time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914tPPkyUBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madhu International","source_asin":"B091KY4D9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091KY4D9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091KY4D9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
