window.products.push({"id":666192,"name":"Hip Flask Holding 6 oz - Circle Pattern Rhinestone Design - Pocket Size, Stainless Steel, Rustproof, Screw-On Cap - Blue, Turquoise and White Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ghqae+kRL._AC_.jpg","description":"This compact 6 oz. hip flask is the perfect size for a purse or pocket. The flask features a circular pattern design made from colorful beads , rhinestones) that are placed by hand onto a super-strong industrial strength adhesive then applied to the flask...These beads will not come off easily this is a cool and traditional flask made with a modern style and flare. Be the first in your circle of friends to own this super awesome hip flask we are offering a lifetime warranty against defects this ultra high quality flask will not leak or turn your alcohol green like those lower quality flasks you see all over the place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ghqae+kRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOP SHELF FLASKS","source_asin":"B00DUFLNJO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DUFLNJO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DUFLNJO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":666193,"name":"LINGTEER Sonic Hedgehog Decorations Set - Happy Birthday Bunting Banner Sonic Hero Hanging Swirls Streamers Sign Perfect for Kids Birthday Party Gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DLvdKdk8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Colorful celebrate your birthday party moment with our birthday decorations. Are you planning an perfect party?Do you want it to be just perfect?Are you looking for beautiful party decorations but don’t have the time to go look for everything? 👑 HIGH-QUALITY DESIGN Our banner are strong enough can keep for many years to comeIn addition,we’ve packaged them all carefully in wrap bags,because sometimes maybe dirty when amazon shipping them also protect them.👑 SPARKLY JEALOUS Ideal for outdoor/indoor parties, as well as other themed party events.Bring happiness to your party these decoration are all you need to give a unique glow to your party.👑 SIZE The banner approximately 3.7ft+4.2ft.✔️Non-toxic, ✔️harmless and ✔️tasteless,please rest assured that it can be used on fireplace or table.👑 UNIQUE MOMENT KEEPSAKE Unique gift in your party ,the amazing quality of the banner can leave a lasting impression on guests, and make your celebration a successful one.You will always remember this moment!!So order now: Why wait till the last moment. Order your party supplies and banner well ahead of the party so you are prepared in advance. Why limit yourself to only one order? Buy as many as you want. Let the party fill with happiness and the hysterical fun they can bring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DLvdKdk8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINGTEER","source_asin":"B08CGVVJGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CGVVJGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CGVVJGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":666194,"name":"Flash Furniture Specter Series Transparent Stacking Side Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dwCPSkPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make a beautiful and artistic statement with this transparent accent chair. With its intricate cut-out design and modern shape, you'll fall in love with this chair. The transparency of the chair allows it to take up less visual space than a solid chair. This chair was crafted with an ingenious combination of lightness and strength. Due to its stacking capabilities, elegant design and use in indoor and outdoor locales this chair can be used in diverse environments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dwCPSkPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B076H3MV5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076H3MV5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076H3MV5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
