window.products.push({"id":666209,"name":"Goplus 7ft Pre-lit Pencil Christmas Tree, Snow Flocked Artificial Hinged Xmas Tree w/ Metal Base, 818 Tips, 350 Lights, Pine Cones & Red Berries, Holi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N1CDDwxJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄Realistic & Dense Branch Tips: With 818 branch tips, this pencil Christmas tree looks lush and full from near and far, highly restoring the appearance of a real tree. There are lots of pine cones and red berry clusters decorated among the branches, making it more vivid and attractive. All tips are sprayed with snow to create a feeling of winter in your house. 🎄Shinning Warm White Lights: This pre-lit Xmas tree has 350 pre-strung warm white lights which can be replaced if burnt out. Certified by UL, the standard plug is suitable for most family to use. No matter day time or night time, you can connect it with power and lit the lights to create a warm holiday atmosphere. 🎄Simple Setup with Hinged Design: The tree comes into 3 sections and one folding metal base for easy installation and storage. Insert the bottom section and fix it with 3 screws. The hinged branches can be expanded easily, thus save your time and energy. Fluff the branch tips to make it fuller. Besides, you can add extra ornaments to decorate your tree. 🎄 High Quality New PVC Leaves: The branch tips are made from 100% new PVC materials to ensure its durability and service life. The branches are strong enough to support the weight of decorations. With excellent characteristics like flame-retardant, odorless and non-toxic, the PVC pencil tree can work for you for a long time. 🎄Wonderful Holiday Decoration: The 7ft delicate artificial pencil tree will play an effective role in inspiring holiday cheer in your home, school, office and holiday parties. You can customize your Christmas tree with your family and friends. Enjoy warm and exciting Christmas and welcome the New Year in a cheerful atmosphere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N1CDDwxJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goplus","source_asin":"B09MHM594L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MHM594L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MHM594L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
