window.products.push({"id":666282,"name":"HUSUE Replacement Battery for V7 5000mAh Compatible with Dyson V7 Motorhead Pro, V7 Car+ Boat, V7 Mattress, V7 Absolute, V7 Trigger, V7 Fluffy + 2 Fil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NpM8KKiWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality and larger capacity V7 replacement battery: Battery type: Rechargeable Lithium-ion | Voltage: 21.6V | Capacity: 5000mAh | Certified: CE, FCC, PSE, RoHS. The whole protective shell is made of high quality ABS material with excellent durability; the inside lithium-ion battery cells and chip is of safe and stable performance. Higher capacity of 5000mAh than others, providing longer working time, ideal for replacing the old one to clean your house. Completely compatible with Dyson V7: HUSUE V7 battery is a good replacement for dyson V7 battery with higher capaciy, it is compatible with Dyson V7 series vacuum cleaners, like V7 Motorhead, V7 Motorhead pro, V7 Fluffy, V7 Animal, V7 Animal Pro+, V7 Trigger, V7 HEPA, V7 Car+boat, V7 Absolute, V7 Mattress, V7 Extra, SV11, 968670, 229687, etc. It also fits the original docking station and charger. (ONLY Fit for V7 Series, NOT fit for V6, V8, V10, DC31) . Stable and safe for use: HUSUE V7 battery replacement for Dyson V7 is made with high quality battery cells, providing fast charging, low power consumption and longer using life. And also the built-in protection chip provides multiple protections with short-circuit protection, over-temperature protection, over-charge protection and over-voltage protection. Easy to install: It's very easy to install and remove the V7 battery from your V7 vacuum cleaner. Firstly remove the screws which connects the battery and the vacuum cleaner, then plug the V7 replacement battery into the vacuum cleaner, and then put back the screws, then you can start to use it. After using, please store the battery in a clean, dry, cool place away from heat and metal objects. Don't charge the V7 battery immediately after it runs out of power, let the battery cool down 10-20 minutes before recharging. Battery replacement for Dyson V7 with indicator light: During charging, Steady blue means charging; Light off means charging completed; Flashing yellow means inside protection system works, stop charging it, wait for some minutes to charge again. During use: Steady blue means working; Flashing blue means need recharging; Flashing yellow means inside protection system works, stop using it, wait for some minutes to use again. Flashing red means error occurred, contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NpM8KKiWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUSUE","source_asin":"B09Q97HGRK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q97HGRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q97HGRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
