window.products.push({"id":666326,"name":"CIVAGO 20oz Insulated Stainless Steel Tumbler, Coffee Tumbler with Lid and Straw, Double Wall Vacuum Leak-proof Travel Coffee Mug, Powder Coated Tumbl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TSXxxRyBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get Your Hands On a 20 oz stainless steel coffee tumbler with lid That Stands Out! BEST GIFT SET !– Best in value for money. Perfect for travelers, students, truck drivers, bus drivers, taxi drivers, teachers, Mother's and Father's Day gifts, Christmas gifts, BBQ experts, party cups, sailors & more.You can take this tumbler anywhere: indoors, outdoors, sports, traveling, camping, driving & office. The shape of our tumblers fits normal sized cup holders Features of CIVAGO 20 oz Stainless Steel Tumbler 1.Large 20 oz (591ml)2.Crystal ransparent Splash Proof Sliding Lid & Straw Friendly3.SWEAT Free Technology4.Flavor FREE, No Metallic Aftertaste5.Rust proof 304 18/8 Food Grade Stainless Steel Construction6.Double Walled Vacuum Thermal Insulation Tips: 1.Wash these cups with sponge cloth or sponge ball dipped into warm water, and set aside to air dry. Do not use cleaners containing bleach, chlorine, abrasives. 2.Please do not wash it in dishwasher in case that the cup glass would be scratched. 3.There is a straw hole on the lid, please do not invert the cup to avoid pouring. 4.Please cover the cap after adding the hot water, and keep it away from little children, Please do not use the microwave oven for heating.5.When filling vessels with boiling liquid, allow liquid to cool down with the lid off for at least 3 minutes before attaching the lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TSXxxRyBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CIVAGO","source_asin":"B0B72VT9X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B72VT9X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B72VT9X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
