window.products.push({"id":666340,"name":"TOALLA 100% Cotton Terry Kitchen Towels|Pack of 12|500 GSM|Bar Towels|Reusable Cleaning Cloths|Super Soft and Absorbent|Tea Towels Sets|Dishcloths for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BVx2gYexL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ASSURANCE OF 100% RINGSPUN COTTON: TOALLA utility pack of 12 KITCHEN TOWELS is extremely absorbent and is perfect for leaving your dinnerware clean. These cleaning towels are very strong and unlikely to stretch or tear so you can get the most out of them. ✅TOWEL DIMENSIONS, COLOR & MORE: These KITCHEN TOWELS measure 18 by 28 Inches and are Gray White Stripe in color. The weave is Terry. This value pack provides you with ample KITCHEN TOWELS for all your household and kitchen needs. Complement your kitchen, dinner table,  home, and bar with soft and durable kitchen towels. These don't retain smells or stains. They can also be used to keep the food warm and prevent it from sogginess. ✅VERSATILE KITCHEN TOWELS: These KITCHEN TOWELS are multi-utility and are capable of regular cleaning as they are made up of high-quality ring-spun cotton that dries quickly. These towels are ideal for cleaning plates and glasses in bars, restaurants, offices, homes, and hotels. These kitchen towels clearance prime also assist in wrapping bread, and cleaning dinner sets. ✅EASY TO CARE AND DURABLE: The soft cotton material is durable and long-lasting that offers you multiple washes by hand and machine. For the best results wash the KITCHEN TOWELS in the machine in cold water and tumble dry at low heat. ✅PERFECT GIFT FOR YOUR LOVED ONES - This set of 12 KITCHEN TOWELS provides a great gifting idea for your loved ones for - Christmas, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Anniversaries and during, Black Friday, and Cyber Monday Sale. Why are you still waiting to buy these KITCHEN TOWELS?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BVx2gYexL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOALLA","source_asin":"B08W29YBRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W29YBRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W29YBRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":666341,"name":"Gaggia 90501 Titanium SS Super Automatic Espresso and Cappuccino Machine, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E9G8G74AL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Titanium SS is our top of the line super automatic espresso and cappuccino machine. You can actually call this super automatic a Coffee Center because it allows you to create practically any coffee drink you could imagine and in most cases, replaces the drip coffee maker altogether. The 100% stainless steel housing encloses the same internals as our Gaggia Titanium, as well as the cobalt blue LCD digital display and seven push buttons that operate many of the features on this well-built machine. Five temperature settings, an on/off timer and clock, three coffee volume settings, pre-infusion, and the pre-grind feature are all programmable through the menu that appears on the cobalt blue digital display. The Gaggia Titanium SS is equipped with two stainless steel-lined boilers that provide a Rapid Steam System, making it powerful enough to brew and then steam with no down time. Features like the bypass doser, adjustable coffee strength, and adjustable grind settings make it possible for you to produce coffeehouse style drinks like a seasoned barista. In addition, the stainless steel turbo-frother and automatic frothing attachment, which dispenses frothed milk directly into your cup, make frothing and steaming a snap, while the bypass doser allows you to add pre-ground decaffeinated or flavored coffee directly into the espresso machine ¿ a fantastic feature for those who entertain in the evening. Simply stated, the Gaggia Titanium SS is a world-class espresso machine that delivers perfect thick, rich, golden crema effortlessly every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E9G8G74AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gaggia","source_asin":"B0009314RQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009314RQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009314RQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":666342,"name":"Hiware 20-piece Seafood Tools Set includes 6 Crab Crackers, 6 Lobster Shellers, 6 Crab Leg Forks/Picks and 2 Seafood Scissors & Storage Bag - Nut Crac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j3oXllrPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Professional Seafood Tools Set includes 6 zinc alloy crab crackers, 6 Food-Grade plastic lobster shellers, 6 stainless steel crab leg forks/picks, 2 stainless steel seafood scissors and 1 cotton storage case. Our versatile set is a must-have in any kitchen, restaurant or parties and makes a fantastic gift to anyone with taste for seafood Heavy Duty and Durable: Solid die-cast zinc alloy crackers with jagged teeth and durable hinges to take significant pressure; High-grade double ended stainless steel forks; Stainless steel shellfish scissors are sharp to cut through tough, shell of crab and lobster legs and are delicate enough to open up small lobster or shrimp; Food-grade and lightweight plastic shellers will crack and peel all legs and claws Safe: Anti-slip grooved inner sides of crab crackers prevent slipping and will grab the object with secure but safe grip; Ergonomic design of the handle secures safe grip; Our set is rustproof and dishwasher safe to last for years to come; Provided cotton pouch will hold all elements together for safekeeping and without worries of misplacing any Mess Free: Ideal for eating whole lobster and crab without worrying about the waste; Our seafood tools will get the meat out of most difficult parts to reach to or out of hardest parts to break; This is a mess-free and fun operation that will leave all the diners clean and satisfied with every bite Perfect and Versatile Gift: With their beautiful finish, timeless design and high purpose, our seafood tools make a unique and appreciative gift to impress friends, family or chefs; Ideal present for house warming parties, Thanksgiving, Christmas or birthdays; This set will look stylish in any household and will be talking point at many parties","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j3oXllrPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIWARE","source_asin":"B07SQ83GKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SQ83GKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SQ83GKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
