window.products.push({"id":666415,"name":"Dexas PinchMitt Silicone Oven Mitt, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-b7-UAPlL._AC_SL1379_.jpg","description":"Silicone oven mitts offer great heat protection, but can be cumbersome for the user in a full oven mitt size. Dexas has an ideal alternative with small Silicone oven mitts that offer superior grip and heat protection in a smaller size that is easier to wear and manuever. Dexas offers these small mitts in three size options, each designed to cover part or all of the user's hand. The \"Mini\" Oven mitt measures 3.5 by 4\" and covers most of the user's hand to the knuckles. The \"Pinchmitt' is a bit smaller at 2.75 by 3.13\" and is perfect for protecting all fingers/thumb. The \"Micromitt\" is the smallest of the small mitt options, at just 2.3 by 2.38.\" The Micromitt is perfect for users that want just thier fingertips covered when lifting hot pots and pans. Each Mini, Pinch, and Micro Mitt over high-heat resistance and raised nibs are specially designed to protect hands while handling hot items. With up to 500 degrees F of heat protection, mitts are perfect for use with ovens, cookie sheets, pot lid handles, stove tops and counters. All mitts can be used right or left handed, and the Micromitt size comes in a set of two (mini and pinch mitts are single). Safe for use near stovetops and indirect heat. Dishwasher safe!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-b7-UAPlL._AC_SL1379_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dexas","source_asin":"B01J1FQSYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J1FQSYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J1FQSYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":666416,"name":"Thank You Candle, Employee Appreciation Gifts, Funny Appreciate Present Ideas for Women Men Best Friends Teacher Team Members, Goodbye Coworkers Leavi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AnzwfRiIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁 UNIQUE THANK YOU GIFT: This lavender scented candle with funny saying “Thank You For Being Awesome” is an ideal appreciation gift for mom, her, husband, wife, father, mother, grandma, grandpa, sister, daughter, brother, staff, aunt, uncle, best friend, girlfriend, boyfriend, bff, besties, mimi, soccer, team members, colleagues, leader, classmates. Also it's a job promotion gift for coworkers, boss, employee, doctor, nurse, assistant, appreciation gifts for teacher, professor. 🎁 A HUGE HIT AT MANY OCCASIONS: This thank you candle is a great gift idea to remind the recipient’s awesomeness, to inspire and cheer them up. Ideal Gifts for Christmas, New Year, Graduation, Birthday, Mother's Day, Boss's Day, Farewell, white elephant, Hanukkah, congratulations, job promotion, long distance friendship, retirement, coworker leaving, baby shower or just because to remind those awesome women of their awesomeness. 🎁 LAVENDER FRAGRANCE: Infused with premium lavender fragrances, this natural soy wax candle is great for sleep-promoting and relief from anxiety, depression, and stress; A perfect addition to the bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, living room, office, etc. It is very long-lasting, up to more than 40 hours, and even if it is not ignited, a slight fragrance can be smelled. 🎁 NATURAL SOY WAX INGREDIENT: Our scented candles are hand-poured in small batches with friend love at heart. They are made from natural, sustainable soy wax, vegan and cruelty-free. Better for the environment, burn more sufficiently and longer. With a lead-free wick designed for continuous burn, the wax melts evenly and consistently. Decorative candle is a amazing gift, perfect for home or office use, aromatherapy, yoga, meditation, family unions. 🎁 PERFECT GIFT IDEA: Packed in a beautiful box, not too heavy to carry, making this 7 ounce lavender jar candle easy to store and place in a small gift bag and bring fresh fragrance to your loved ones anytime & anywhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AnzwfRiIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOONAWAX","source_asin":"B0BGMDH9W6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGMDH9W6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGMDH9W6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
