window.products.push({"id":666471,"name":"GOGO 12 Pieces Large White Dove Balloons, Helium Balloons For Wedding Birthday Ceremony","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xxjaqbCSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These GOGO Doves balloons are made of material -- Polyolefin. Price for 12 pieces.Color: WhiteSize: Approximately 37\" x 17\" when fully inflated (94cm x 44cm)Instructions:1. Fill your Eco Doves with helium, taking care not to overfill. Fill the doves until they begin to take shape. Stop filling when the wings look full, but not stretched tight. Please clench the seal tightly after inflating.2. Stick the tail on the bottom of the dove3. Use string to tie the dove to a rope or other weighted object.4. When ready to launch, simply cut the strings and the doves will fly away, swooping and circling in the sky.Attention:Once inflated with helium and released, the balloons can float for more than 24 hours, but we recommend that you inflate them on the morning of your wedding or event.The rate of ascent is much slower that a standard helium balloon allowing you to enjoy them for longer - it will rise more like a bird, twisting and fluttering, but wind will be a factor. Finally, it decomposes into water, carbon dioxide, and biomass.Please note that helium is not included.Its an ideal special spectacle for Weddings, Christenings, Birthdays, and Memorials/Funerals. They will make your event very special, magical and unforgettable. As Eco-Friendly balloons, they are very popular and adopted extensively in the world.WARNING:Adult supervision required.Keep uninflated balloons from children.Discard broken balloons at once.CHOKING HAZARD -- Small parts. Not for children under 3 yrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xxjaqbCSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOGO","source_asin":"B001JETQP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001JETQP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001JETQP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
