window.products.push({"id":666807,"name":"4 in 1 Multi-Functional Digital Alarm Clock with Calendar, Thermometer, Timer. Backlit Square LCD Display for Bedroom, Office & More. Accurate, Simple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613dJOgk0NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Highlights: A simple and stylish square alarm clock with calendar, timer, and thermometer. Easy-to-read large LCD screens with clear color changes between functions. User-friendly setting approach. A home and office must-have that reminds you time and temperature change and a practical tool for work / study efficiency and health management. 4-in-1 Multiple Functions, Rotate to Change: Rotate the clock to quickly switch 1. Digital Alarm Clock - Light Blue Equipped with nap function. 2. Temperature Monitor - Navy Blue Range -20-40 Degree C 3. Calendar - Red Year/month/day/hour/minute/week from 1900 to 2099 4. Timer - Green From 0 to 99 min 59 sec Quick User Guide: 1.Timer In TIMER status, press SET button to enter respectively adjusting status of Minute and second. Press UP button to adjust the number you want. Press SET to begin the count down. 2. Calendar In CALENDAR status, press SET button continuously to enter the adjusting status of Hour/Minute/Day/Yean Press UP button to adjust the number you wanted. 3. Alarm In the ALARM DISPLAY status, press SET button to enter respectively the adjusting Status of ALARM hour and minute. Press UP to adjust the number, press the SET button to finish the alarm time setting and the alarm function will be acted automatic. Press SET button once more to close the alarm function. 4.Temperature In the TEMPERATURE status, it displays indoor temperature. Press UP button to select the Degree C or Degree F display version. Materials:ABS frame; LCD screen Battery: 2* 1.5V AA batteries. (Not included in the package)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613dJOgk0NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ubrand","source_asin":"B08SKHGLXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-666807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SKHGLXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SKHGLXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
